            "review_title": "Review at The Rusty Bucket",
            "review_text": "Tamquat\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam38 contributions\n0\nFriendly\nFeb 2021\nThis Canadian owned bar is a great place to visit as it is so friendly and interesting..\nThe beers are icy cold as the glasses come out of the freezer. The food supplied is Asian/Western with a hint of Canadian influence.\n\nUpstairs they have a pool table with the competition about to get underway.\n\nSaturday night is FREE BBQ from 7.00pm if you buy a drink.\n\nRecommend for an evening out with Happy Hours from 4 to 7 pm every day.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 5, 2021",
